      "group": "Control and status",
      "area": "holding",
      "address": 11,
      "type": "uint16",
      "access": "R",
      "description": "0: No error present 65535(-1 if it is read as signed value): Error in the communication of Gateway or Remote Controller with the AC unit. Any other value, see the table at the end of this document."
